    <item>
      <title>AgentPresso 0.1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 May 2026 16:36:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p><strong>Initial public release</strong> of AgentPresso — an AI-native WordPress agent for macOS.</p>

        <h3>Key Features</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Conversational AI agent for autonomous WordPress site management</li>
          <li>Built-in skills: WP-CLI, admin browser, security, SEO, theme development, plugin management, database, content creation, Gutenberg blocks, REST API, WooCommerce</li>
          <li>Multi-site management with Freemius license activation</li>
          <li>Customizable settings: skills toggle, model selection, permissions, licensing, appearance</li>
          <li>Sparkle auto-updates — always stay on the latest version</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>System Requirements</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>macOS 14.0 (Sonoma) or later</li>
          <li>Apple Silicon or Intel Mac</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
